WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 23=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:51.120 --> 01:52.119
Uncle Zhao.

01:52.480 --> 01:53.440
Brother Zhao.

01:54.120 --> 01:56.720
What brings you here, Jinqi?

01:59.319 --> 02:01.960
I arranged to watch
Furong's performance with friends.

02:02.000 --> 02:04.598
We'd barely spoken a few words
when Furong was taken away.

02:04.599 --> 02:05.759
They said

02:05.799 --> 02:07.999
a distinguished guest
had lost something important,

02:08.000 --> 02:09.600
so the entire troupe had to be searched.

02:10.000 --> 02:12.639
So it's Uncle Zhao and Brother Zhao.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.799
My apologies.

02:15.120 --> 02:17.239
Furong and the other performers

02:17.240 --> 02:18.840
need to cooperate with our questioning.

02:19.319 --> 02:20.959
They can't see any visitors.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.680
Hold out both hands.

02:28.936 --> 02:31.210
(The index finger on
the deposed Crown Prince's left hand)

02:31.220 --> 02:33.190
(is half a joint longer
than his middle finger,)

02:33.200 --> 02:34.376
(making it unusually long.)

02:35.599 --> 02:37.638
These soldiers
aren't exactly meticulous.

02:37.639 --> 02:39.718
When it comes
to searching for lost items,

02:39.719 --> 02:42.400
the Five City Patrol Office
is better suited to the task.

02:42.616 --> 02:43.510
Why not send someone...

02:43.520 --> 02:46.000
I appreciate the offer, Jinqi.

02:46.240 --> 02:48.559
We've already brought in enough men.

02:48.560 --> 02:50.392
There's no need
to trouble the Patrol Office.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.399
Once you two finish
over there, come with me.

02:52.400 --> 02:54.759
May I ask what you've lost, Uncle Zhao?

02:54.888 --> 02:56.152
I've had some experience

02:56.184 --> 02:58.510
investigating cases
and finding missing items.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.478
I'd be glad to help.

02:59.479 --> 03:00.519
No need.

03:01.400 --> 03:02.638
It's only a family matter.

03:02.639 --> 03:04.280
There's no need to trouble you, Jinqi.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.680
Forgive my presumption.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.598
I forgot to introduce them.

03:14.599 --> 03:15.799
This is Scholar Han.

03:15.800 --> 03:17.840
He's currently studying at Qixia Academy

03:17.879 --> 03:19.600
under Scholar Shouyi.

03:21.000 --> 03:23.400
Greetings, Judicial Officer Zhao.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.079
And this

03:27.319 --> 03:29.038
is Mister Jia,

03:29.039 --> 03:30.759
from Kunshan, Suzhou.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.759
Uncle Zhao,

03:32.792 --> 03:33.950
if you enjoy Kunshan opera...

03:33.960 --> 03:35.320
You have guests, Jinqi.

03:35.599 --> 03:37.039
You should attend to them.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.470
There's nothing particularly urgent

03:38.479 --> 03:39.878
I need to attend to.

03:39.879 --> 03:41.799
What are you still standing there for?

03:41.960 --> 03:44.160
Hurry and see Jinqi out.

03:44.919 --> 03:46.039
Jinqi,

03:46.199 --> 03:47.320
this way, please.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.120
I'll take my leave.

03:58.560 --> 03:59.479
Please.

04:03.639 --> 04:04.639
Hold out your hand.

04:05.479 --> 04:07.759
I still have matters to attend to,
so I won't see you out.

04:15.360 --> 04:17.959
I thought they'd question us at length.

04:18.279 --> 04:19.399
But instead,

04:19.879 --> 04:21.560
they escorted us straight out.

04:21.879 --> 04:25.199
They seemed afraid Commander Lin
might stay even a moment longer.

04:25.759 --> 04:27.440
What exactly are they looking for?

04:30.240 --> 04:31.759
How would I know?

05:00.600 --> 05:01.719
This way, please.

05:03.199 --> 05:04.959
Uncle Liu, come here.

05:08.860 --> 05:14.838
(Sanjue Hall)

05:14.839 --> 05:16.000
Did you get a good look?

05:18.319 --> 05:19.398
I did.

05:19.399 --> 05:21.999
Find a body of similar build
at the public burial ground.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.119
Use it as a decoy

05:23.120 --> 05:24.959
to throw Zhao Xuede off the trail.

05:25.399 --> 05:26.519
Yes.

05:40.759 --> 05:42.240
Make the nose a little rounder.

05:49.519 --> 05:50.440
Will this do?

05:50.839 --> 05:51.638
Yes.

05:51.639 --> 05:54.159
Make this earlobe a little bigger.

06:01.519 --> 06:02.398
Yesterday,

06:02.399 --> 06:04.290
when he was moving
costumes with Young Lady Xu,

06:04.300 --> 06:05.318
he brushed past me.

06:05.319 --> 06:07.320
He looked unfamiliar,
so I took a closer look.

06:09.079 --> 06:10.398
Anyone trusted to handle

06:10.399 --> 06:12.399
his master's dirty work

06:12.879 --> 06:14.318
must have some standing

06:14.319 --> 06:15.919
and money to spare.

06:15.920 --> 06:18.000
Check the taverns
and teahouses he frequents

06:18.079 --> 06:19.638
and find out everything about him.

06:19.639 --> 06:20.599
Yes.

06:21.199 --> 06:22.320
Scholar Han,

06:22.399 --> 06:23.359
please go back

06:23.360 --> 06:24.559
and tell Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu

06:24.560 --> 06:25.719
that we have a lead.

06:25.720 --> 06:28.360
I'll let them know
as soon as I have news.

06:28.759 --> 06:29.880
Scholar Han,

06:30.079 --> 06:31.120
please.

06:37.439 --> 06:38.039
Uncle Liu...

06:38.040 --> 06:39.240
There's something else

06:39.576 --> 06:41.270
I'd like to discuss with him in private.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.159
Scholar Han,

06:51.920 --> 06:53.120
you should go home.

06:57.759 --> 06:59.000
I'll take my leave.

07:12.839 --> 07:14.000
When you changed clothes

07:14.240 --> 07:16.240
and disguised yourself as a playwright,

07:16.879 --> 07:18.959
I noticed that the index finger
on your left hand

07:19.519 --> 07:20.759
was missing a section.

07:31.079 --> 07:32.240
When I was young,

07:32.959 --> 07:34.639
I made a living selling firewood.

07:35.639 --> 07:37.399
While cutting wood in the mountains,

07:41.439 --> 07:43.599
I accidentally chopped off
part of my finger.

07:47.160 --> 07:48.560
How did you end up

07:48.632 --> 07:50.190
working as a laborer with the troupe?

07:51.959 --> 07:54.000
When I delivered firewood to Mister Lu,

07:54.959 --> 07:56.120
Mister Lu

07:56.360 --> 07:58.360
saw how hard it was for me
to make a living

07:59.279 --> 08:01.000
and found me work with the troupe,

08:02.040 --> 08:03.599
so I could make a living.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.759
Zhao Xuede is close to Prince Han.

08:11.176 --> 08:13.830
He must be helping Prince Han
search for something he lost.

08:14.920 --> 08:16.320
As it happens,

08:17.040 --> 08:19.159
the Crown Prince has also lost something

08:19.560 --> 08:21.120
and is searching everywhere for it.

08:22.920 --> 08:24.040
Today,

08:25.160 --> 08:26.759
they can surround the troupe.

08:27.079 --> 08:27.959
Tomorrow,

08:29.279 --> 08:31.440
they could surround all of Jinling City.

08:43.639 --> 08:45.400
I'll put you on a ship

08:46.720 --> 08:48.040
and get you out of Jinling.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.798
I've heard that overseas,

08:55.799 --> 08:57.839
there are also
communities of our people.

08:58.840 --> 09:00.160
In a new place,

09:01.080 --> 09:03.199
perhaps you can put
your skills to good use

09:04.120 --> 09:05.599
and live the life you want,

09:06.559 --> 09:08.160
instead of hiding away in one corner

09:08.679 --> 09:10.199
just trying to survive.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.079
Why?

09:14.000 --> 09:15.320
First, you've committed no crime.

09:17.039 --> 09:17.760
Second,

09:19.440 --> 09:21.680
I don't want Mister Lu and Furong

09:22.200 --> 09:24.239
to pay with their lives

09:24.879 --> 09:26.400
for an act of kindness.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.560
Too much innocent blood

09:32.039 --> 09:34.719
has already
been spilled in Jinling City.

09:35.500 --> 09:43.340
♪With my own hands and heart,
I write my name♪

09:43.740 --> 09:50.619
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

09:50.620 --> 09:57.079
♪With what I know and do,
I rewrite my fate♪

09:57.080 --> 09:58.199
I'll leave.

09:58.300 --> 10:09.780
♪As the long night ends,
I no longer question the past♪

10:35.759 --> 10:36.879
Uncle Xu.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.839
Go inside and lie down for a while.

10:39.320 --> 10:41.398
Once we hear from Commander Lin,

10:41.399 --> 10:42.999
you'll need your strength to help.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.560
Is this the Xu residence?

11:06.904 --> 11:08.216
I'm Tao, an official matchmaker.

11:08.248 --> 11:10.550
The Han family asked me
to come and propose marriage.

11:10.550 --> 11:11.352
Madam Tao!

11:11.360 --> 11:12.758
Mother, someone's here to see you.

11:12.759 --> 11:13.560
Madam Han.

11:16.240 --> 11:17.920
Madam Han!

11:18.039 --> 11:19.518
What's going on, Madam Han?

11:19.519 --> 11:20.719
Let's talk outside.

11:21.016 --> 11:21.912
Madam Han, weren't you

11:21.960 --> 11:24.630
the one who asked me to come
propose marriage to the Xu family?

11:24.639 --> 11:26.119
I came rushing over here,

11:26.120 --> 11:28.040
so why are you pushing me out?

11:28.240 --> 11:29.959
Even if you've changed your mind,

11:29.960 --> 11:31.599
you should've told me beforehand.

11:31.600 --> 11:33.038
I'm sorry.

11:33.039 --> 11:34.839
So much has happened these past few days

11:34.840 --> 11:37.040
that I completely forgot to tell you.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.199
Madam Tao,

11:38.240 --> 11:40.040
our family hasn't changed its mind.

11:40.240 --> 11:42.199
It's just not a good day
to propose marriage.

11:43.039 --> 11:45.680
I'm sorry you came
all this way for nothing.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.158
Scholar Han, don't worry.

11:48.159 --> 11:49.798
As for you and the Xu family's daughter,

11:49.799 --> 11:51.079
leave it to me.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.640
Take care, Madam Tao.

11:52.879 --> 11:54.239
I'll be going, Madam Han.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.359
Goodbye.

11:56.600 --> 11:58.040
Two coins for doing nothing.

12:12.759 --> 12:15.320
How long has Commander Lin been here?

12:16.279 --> 12:17.320
I just arrived.

12:18.960 --> 12:19.839
Mother,

12:20.240 --> 12:21.599
go make dinner first.

12:34.759 --> 12:35.918
Do you have any leads?

12:35.919 --> 12:36.599
We've identified

12:36.600 --> 12:38.440
the man who posed as a laborer.

12:38.720 --> 12:39.800
However,

12:40.120 --> 12:41.440
someone silenced him for good.

12:41.519 --> 12:42.719
He's dead?

12:43.120 --> 12:44.640
This is Jinling City.

12:44.799 --> 12:45.918
Who could possibly

12:45.919 --> 12:47.079
disregard the law

12:47.080 --> 12:48.560
and kill as if it were nothing?

12:51.799 --> 12:54.160
Someone neither of us
can afford to cross right now.

12:54.616 --> 12:56.830
Knowing who it is would only
cause you more worry.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.839
This all started because of me.

13:02.159 --> 13:03.599
I was careless

13:03.600 --> 13:05.040
and dragged Lanxiang into this.

13:05.879 --> 13:07.320
I'm too ashamed to go inside.

13:07.759 --> 13:09.560
Please tell Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu

13:10.240 --> 13:12.038
that I will bring Lanxiang back

13:12.039 --> 13:13.719
and apologize to them in person.

13:15.519 --> 13:17.040
Where exactly is Lanxiang?

13:19.039 --> 13:21.359
All we know so far is that
she was taken out of Jinling.

13:21.639 --> 13:23.359
The trail goes cold after that.

13:24.279 --> 13:25.760
She's no longer in Jinling?

13:27.540 --> 13:32.420
(Yangzhou City)

13:43.100 --> 13:45.899
(Qingyan House)

13:45.900 --> 13:49.500
(Intoxicated Moon in the Mist)

14:25.320 --> 14:27.678
(Xiaopu)
She says she's feeling unwell

14:27.679 --> 14:29.800
and doesn't want
to see any guests today.

14:34.039 --> 14:37.760
She's unwell ten days
out of every month.

14:37.960 --> 14:39.638
She finally gets a customer

14:39.639 --> 14:41.479
and still gives him an attitude.

14:41.480 --> 14:43.158
(Liu Yueniang, Owner of Qingyan House)

14:43.159 --> 14:44.320
Fine.

14:44.639 --> 14:46.440
She's our star courtesan, after all.

14:46.799 --> 14:49.599
We all have to indulge her a little.

14:58.460 --> 15:01.900
(Zhi)

15:10.279 --> 15:11.599
Behave yourself.

15:16.000 --> 15:17.320
Trying to escape?

15:20.679 --> 15:22.038
If it were that easy

15:22.039 --> 15:24.199
to escape from me,

15:24.399 --> 15:26.638
then I, Liu Yueniang,
would've lived over forty years

15:26.639 --> 15:28.599
for nothing.

15:30.799 --> 15:32.239
I was tricked into coming here.

15:32.480 --> 15:33.199
Please...

15:34.679 --> 15:35.920
Please...

15:38.440 --> 15:39.560
Lift your head.

15:39.600 --> 15:40.560
Don't move.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.359
Girl,

15:48.799 --> 15:51.999
I don't care whether
your parents sold you here

15:52.200 --> 15:54.560
or traffickers tricked you
into coming here.

15:55.039 --> 15:57.920
Once you enter my Qingyan House,

15:58.639 --> 16:02.038
even if you were once a princess
or a prince's consort,

16:02.039 --> 16:04.400
you'll still have to serve customers.

16:17.480 --> 16:18.599
Not bad.

16:18.799 --> 16:20.640
You've got a pretty face.

16:21.000 --> 16:23.199
Change her clothes
and put some makeup on her.

16:23.440 --> 16:25.760
The customer is still waiting.

16:25.840 --> 16:27.079
All right.

16:30.440 --> 16:31.640
Are you crazy?

16:38.720 --> 16:39.599
You...

16:44.960 --> 16:47.079
You think doing this

16:47.399 --> 16:49.239
means you won't have to serve customers?

16:50.200 --> 16:51.999
Silly girl.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.839
Let me tell you,

16:53.840 --> 16:56.959
plenty of men like this sort of thing.

17:00.039 --> 17:02.920
If she doesn't even care about herself,

17:03.039 --> 17:05.240
I won't waste my effort, either.

17:05.519 --> 17:06.758
Gag her.

17:06.759 --> 17:08.558
Just send her over like this.

17:08.559 --> 17:09.760
Understood.

17:10.240 --> 17:11.359
Hold her down.

17:11.599 --> 17:13.399
No!

17:13.640 --> 17:14.919
Open your mouth.

17:35.000 --> 17:38.078
I don't know
why she's putting up such a fight.

17:38.079 --> 17:40.719
Once I get my hands on you,

17:40.720 --> 17:42.879
even if you die,

17:43.119 --> 17:46.760
I'll still squeeze every last bit
of profit from your bones.

18:13.240 --> 18:15.040
Your face is quite pretty.

18:17.519 --> 18:18.720
But these hands...

18:20.720 --> 18:22.520
Madam, my hands may be rough,

18:22.640 --> 18:25.159
but I can play music, chess,
write calligraphy, and paint.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.960
I can also perform opera.

18:29.119 --> 18:30.439
With hands like these,

18:31.319 --> 18:33.159
you claim you can do all four arts?

18:33.720 --> 18:35.399
Who are you trying to fool?

18:43.960 --> 18:46.040
May I borrow the fan
at your waist, Madam?

19:50.119 --> 19:52.720
I really misjudged you.

19:54.960 --> 19:56.079
Madam,

19:56.119 --> 19:58.118
if you're too eager to make a sale,

19:58.119 --> 20:01.040
even the finest goods
won't fetch a good price.

20:01.720 --> 20:04.399
Why not build up some interest first?

20:04.640 --> 20:06.280
Make it something rare and sought after,

20:06.319 --> 20:08.119
and then wait for the highest offer.

20:19.920 --> 20:22.399
You're a clever one.

20:23.119 --> 20:25.040
But in our line of work,

20:25.680 --> 20:28.040
a pretty face alone isn't enough.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.599
You

20:30.440 --> 20:33.040
have to be shrewder than men

20:33.400 --> 20:35.358
if you want to get

20:35.359 --> 20:37.200
all their money out of them.

20:40.920 --> 20:43.239
You're just pretending to play along

20:43.240 --> 20:45.919
so you can stall for time
and escape, aren't you?

20:51.279 --> 20:53.560
But you were right about one thing.

20:55.960 --> 20:59.280
You won't get a good price
if you're too eager to sell.

21:00.119 --> 21:02.560
We'll spend a day preparing properly

21:03.079 --> 21:05.518
and invite all
the wealthy men in Yangzhou

21:05.519 --> 21:07.359
to come here.

21:07.400 --> 21:10.518
Whoever comes out on top

21:10.519 --> 21:12.359
will become

21:14.119 --> 21:15.480
our Liu Qing...

21:16.240 --> 21:19.960
Young Lady Liu Qing's very first patron.

21:21.759 --> 21:24.639
I won't disappoint you, Madam.

21:27.640 --> 21:30.480
Tomorrow will be your big day.

21:31.079 --> 21:32.999
I won't give you any chance

21:33.000 --> 21:35.240
to disappoint me.

21:52.519 --> 21:53.639
There's news.

21:53.640 --> 21:54.439
Sit.

21:54.728 --> 21:56.184
The clues you gave me were limited.

21:56.232 --> 21:58.270
Luckily, I've been keeping
an eye on Duke Xianguo.

21:58.270 --> 22:00.220
As it happens,
I managed to find a lead for you.

22:00.440 --> 22:02.479
Last night, there was indeed
a suspicious vessel

22:02.480 --> 22:04.480
that left Jinling for Yangzhou.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.439
I've sent men after it.

22:06.440 --> 22:08.038
As long as Young Lady Xu is in Yangzhou,

22:08.039 --> 22:09.879
we'll have news
within two or three days.

22:11.720 --> 22:13.040
I want to go to Yangzhou.

22:13.400 --> 22:15.800
Young Lady Xu was struck
by this misfortune because of me.

22:16.079 --> 22:17.800
I have to bring her back.

22:24.519 --> 22:26.760
His Majesty's health is getting worse.

22:26.880 --> 22:28.000
Things

22:28.079 --> 22:29.280
may be about to change.

22:31.519 --> 22:33.399
But the Crown Prince is still in Jinling.

22:33.480 --> 22:35.630
Won't His Majesty
summon him back to the capital?

22:36.552 --> 22:39.070
I don't know whether
no imperial decree was ever issued

22:39.079 --> 22:41.439
or it simply can't reach Jinling.

22:42.088 --> 22:44.120
The Crown Prince
is extremely anxious right now.

22:44.248 --> 22:46.410
But returning to the capital
without an imperial decree

22:46.424 --> 22:47.670
would amount to treason.

22:48.880 --> 22:51.558
Besides, Zheng Baichuan
is close to Prince Han.

22:51.559 --> 22:52.919
Without an imperial decree,

22:52.960 --> 22:55.359
Zheng Baichuan will never
let the Crown Prince leave the city.

22:56.319 --> 22:58.359
Zheng Baichuan is only
the Joint Defense Commander.

22:58.360 --> 22:59.550
The Central Military Command's

22:59.559 --> 23:01.500
Commander, Duke Xiangguo,
is the Defense Commander.

23:01.510 --> 23:02.910
As long as Duke Xiangguo is willing,

23:03.160 --> 23:05.119
the gates of Jinling
cannot remain sealed.

23:05.640 --> 23:06.999
Prince Han and the Crown Prince

23:07.000 --> 23:09.079
are both Duke Xiangguo's
biological nephews.

23:09.240 --> 23:10.959
Whichever of them ascends the throne,

23:10.960 --> 23:13.320
Duke Xiangguo will be
the Emperor's maternal uncle.

23:15.384 --> 23:17.030
He has always remained on the sidelines,

23:17.039 --> 23:18.399
supporting neither side.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.720
But in Jinling now,

23:20.559 --> 23:23.359
Joint Defense Commander,
Zheng Baichuan calls the shots.

23:27.079 --> 23:28.079
Yuan,

23:28.720 --> 23:31.639
Zheng Baichuan is ruthless
and utterly without principle.

23:31.944 --> 23:33.656
He betrayed
the deposed Emperor back then

23:33.700 --> 23:36.230
and offered Jinling City
to His Majesty to prove his allegiance.

23:36.248 --> 23:38.590
Now he could just as easily
offer the Crown Prince's head

23:38.640 --> 23:40.240
to Prince Han to prove his allegiance.

23:47.559 --> 23:49.079
Forgive my bold words,

23:49.319 --> 23:50.839
but every word comes from the heart.

24:08.039 --> 24:09.439
You're right to remind me.

24:10.160 --> 24:11.959
With or without an imperial decree,

24:11.960 --> 24:13.719
Prince Han will never
let the Crown Prince

24:13.720 --> 24:15.320
leave Jinling alive.

24:18.079 --> 24:20.040
The Crown Prince's life is in danger.

24:20.424 --> 24:23.288
If he is to have any chance of survival,
he must return to the capital.

24:24.776 --> 24:26.350
But the Naval Camp is outside the city.

24:26.359 --> 24:27.639
There's nothing I can do.

24:31.279 --> 24:32.439
Fengtai,

24:32.839 --> 24:35.800
you're the only one
with troops inside the city right now.

24:36.559 --> 24:40.040
Please help the Crown Prince
leave Jinling.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.399
My forces are limited.

24:48.000 --> 24:49.960
I can't confront Zheng Baichuan head-on.

24:50.119 --> 24:52.479
However, if we can create
a diversion in plain sight

24:52.480 --> 24:54.050
while secretly taking another route,

24:54.079 --> 24:55.159
I'm confident

24:55.160 --> 24:57.280
I can escort the Crown Prince
safely out of the city.

25:01.160 --> 25:03.239
Secretly taking another route...

25:03.240 --> 25:04.480
I understand.

25:04.920 --> 25:07.040
But how do we create the diversion?

25:09.279 --> 25:11.118
I went to the troupe today

25:11.119 --> 25:12.480
and came up with an idea.

25:12.568 --> 25:14.270
You're getting married on the sixth.

25:14.279 --> 25:16.879
The Crown Prince and Zheng Baichuan
will both attend.

25:16.920 --> 25:18.919
Hire the best troupe in all of Jinling

25:18.920 --> 25:20.720
and have them
put on a grand performance.

25:21.920 --> 25:23.118
That won't be difficult.

25:23.119 --> 25:24.719
The Crown Prince enjoys opera.

25:24.720 --> 25:25.880
It would be perfectly natural

25:25.912 --> 25:27.830
for me to arrange
a troupe to perform for him.

25:28.616 --> 25:30.008
Then prepare well for your wedding.

25:30.056 --> 25:31.460
I'll make a trip to Yangzhou first.

25:31.519 --> 25:32.800
Are you out of your mind?

25:33.319 --> 25:34.838
At a time when lives are at stake,

25:34.839 --> 25:36.598
you're still going
to Yangzhou for a woman?

25:36.600 --> 25:37.416
Let me ask you this.

25:37.432 --> 25:39.510
If the Crown Prince
is to return safely to the capital,

25:39.519 --> 25:41.320
should he travel overland or by water?

25:47.380 --> 25:48.660
(Canal Transport Map)

25:56.660 --> 25:59.620
(Jinling, Yangzhou)

26:01.440 --> 26:03.520
In that case, for both
official and personal reasons,

26:03.680 --> 26:05.480
you need to make a trip to Yangzhou.

26:07.559 --> 26:10.040
Now you have the search
for Young Lady Xu as a reason to go,

26:10.050 --> 26:11.879
so Zheng Baichuan won't
be suspicious either.

26:12.640 --> 26:14.240
As soon as the city gates open tomorrow,

26:14.519 --> 26:16.040
I'll set out for Yangzhou.

26:16.580 --> 26:20.180
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

26:21.000 --> 26:21.919
Sirs,

26:21.920 --> 26:23.119
please board.

26:42.480 --> 26:43.200
Boatman.

26:43.839 --> 26:44.679
Boatman.

26:48.480 --> 26:49.439
Boatman.

26:49.880 --> 26:51.199
Are you going to Yangzhou?

26:51.200 --> 26:52.679
We're going to Yangzhou, too.

26:53.519 --> 26:54.639
Scholar Han?

27:02.279 --> 27:03.399
I'm sorry.

27:03.448 --> 27:06.150
These two examination candidates
want to enjoy the scenery and paint,

27:06.160 --> 27:08.250
so they've chartered
the entire boat. You'll have to

27:08.260 --> 27:10.040
find another boat.

27:11.079 --> 27:12.200
Sorry to trouble you.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.760
Uncle Liu from the Furong Troupe

27:26.160 --> 27:28.000
got drunk, fell into
the water, and drowned.

27:28.359 --> 27:29.598
By now, his body

27:29.600 --> 27:31.304
should have been recovered

27:31.352 --> 27:33.200
by men from
the Western City Patrol Office.

27:39.559 --> 27:40.520
Set sail.

27:51.580 --> 27:53.900
(Qingyan House)

28:20.039 --> 28:21.679
Young Lady Liu Qing,

28:22.519 --> 28:25.879
even if you manage to shake us two off,

28:25.920 --> 28:28.584
there are two more guarding
the window below.

28:28.696 --> 28:30.320
And that's not counting those upstairs.

28:30.720 --> 28:32.078
There are four more

28:32.079 --> 28:35.280
on the stairs and outside
the main entrance.

28:37.559 --> 28:38.599
You

28:39.400 --> 28:41.439
can't escape.

28:44.519 --> 28:46.919
Gold! It's gold!

28:50.079 --> 28:52.040
I'm determined to have her.

29:00.079 --> 29:01.999
Congratulations, Young Master Wang.

29:02.000 --> 29:05.078
You'll be Young Lady Liu Qing's
first patron today.

29:05.079 --> 29:07.320
- Good!
- Good!

29:07.359 --> 29:08.480
Congratulations!

29:09.440 --> 29:10.720
Exactly.

29:11.319 --> 29:13.119
I'm just nervous.

29:13.160 --> 29:14.439
I'm just looking around

29:14.440 --> 29:15.439
and getting some air.

29:16.759 --> 29:18.359
You're too kind.

29:19.079 --> 29:21.798
I'll take you upstairs
to see Young Lady Liu Qing right now.

29:21.799 --> 29:22.599
Good.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.439
Good.

29:46.200 --> 29:48.038
Isn't this Young Lady Shuang?

29:48.039 --> 29:50.399
What brings you here?

29:51.480 --> 29:53.879
I came to see Madam's new favorite

29:54.000 --> 29:55.839
and find out what she looks like.

29:56.400 --> 29:58.000
Both of you, leave us.

29:58.319 --> 30:00.278
I have a few private words

30:00.279 --> 30:02.159
to say to this young lady.

30:02.440 --> 30:03.639
Well...

30:04.119 --> 30:05.599
I'm afraid we can't do that.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.919
Madam Liu specifically told us

30:07.920 --> 30:10.078
that we must never leave
Young Lady Liu Qing

30:10.079 --> 30:11.719
alone.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.760
How is she alone?

30:14.480 --> 30:16.320
Xiaopu and I are both here.

30:16.359 --> 30:17.599
Well...

30:24.079 --> 30:25.240
What?

30:25.519 --> 30:27.119
Now that there's someone new,

30:27.359 --> 30:29.079
my word means nothing?

30:38.960 --> 30:41.320
I haven't lost my looks yet,

30:41.960 --> 30:43.760
but I can't even

30:44.799 --> 30:46.520
give orders to you two anymore?

30:46.960 --> 30:47.960
Well...

30:51.160 --> 30:53.240
I'm in a hurry to meet Master Wei.

30:53.440 --> 30:54.800
I'll only say a few words.

31:04.279 --> 31:05.320
Well...

31:06.160 --> 31:09.079
Fine. Let's go. Come on.

31:20.599 --> 31:21.919
We'll change clothes.

31:22.000 --> 31:23.278
Xiaopu will take you out.

31:23.279 --> 31:24.399
Ji'er?

31:24.839 --> 31:26.159
Why is it you?

31:26.799 --> 31:27.879
Enough talk. Come.

31:27.880 --> 31:28.480
Sit.

31:33.079 --> 31:34.078
Back then,

31:34.079 --> 31:35.518
I was such a fool.

31:35.519 --> 31:36.679
I couldn't tell good from bad.

31:36.920 --> 31:38.720
You warned me time and again,

31:38.839 --> 31:39.919
but I ignored you

31:39.920 --> 31:41.359
and never listened.

31:43.359 --> 31:45.560
The only reason I survived

31:45.880 --> 31:47.079
that vicious Zhao Xingtang

31:47.480 --> 31:49.040
was because of your warnings.

31:49.799 --> 31:50.760
Now,

31:51.359 --> 31:53.079
consider this my way of repaying you.

31:59.599 --> 32:01.359
What will happen to you after I leave?

32:04.839 --> 32:06.320
Don't worry.

32:07.240 --> 32:08.800
As long as I still have this face,

32:10.160 --> 32:11.439
and as long as those men

32:11.440 --> 32:12.879
still want to sleep with me,

32:12.880 --> 32:15.200
Madam Liu won't dare do much to me.

32:15.279 --> 32:17.159
At worst,

32:17.519 --> 32:18.919
she'll make me take more customers

32:19.160 --> 32:20.560
and earn more money for her.

32:27.464 --> 32:29.464
I've been in this brothel
for almost two years.

32:29.544 --> 32:32.000
Don't tell me you still think
I'm an innocent young woman.

32:36.079 --> 32:37.118
Come.

32:37.119 --> 32:38.320
Hurry and change.

32:42.039 --> 32:42.960
Take it off.

32:44.519 --> 32:45.599
Come, turn around.

32:54.079 --> 32:55.720
This is as far as I can help you.

32:56.279 --> 32:57.399
You

32:57.440 --> 32:59.199
must escape from Yangzhou

32:59.200 --> 33:00.480
and get back to Jinling.

33:00.920 --> 33:02.599
Don't let all my efforts go to waste.

33:07.200 --> 33:08.399
Ji'er,

33:10.000 --> 33:11.200
wait for me.

33:11.400 --> 33:13.359
I'll come back and buy your freedom.

33:27.680 --> 33:29.520
I promise I'll get you out.

33:35.559 --> 33:36.520
All right.

33:37.599 --> 33:38.679
I'll wait for you.

33:39.020 --> 33:41.980
♪A lone figure
wanders down the old lane♪

33:42.180 --> 33:44.479
♪The heart remembers
what time cannot erase♪

33:44.480 --> 33:45.912
I'll wait for you to come save me.

33:45.960 --> 33:50.260
♪One thought brings sorrow,
another dreams of brighter days♪

33:56.119 --> 33:57.798
I'll keep your secret if you want,

33:57.799 --> 33:58.839
but

33:59.079 --> 34:01.079
you'll have to listen to me from now on.

34:01.440 --> 34:02.760
You mean it?

34:02.960 --> 34:05.358
When I give my word, I mean it.

34:05.359 --> 34:06.760
I always keep my word.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.598
You were too scared to sleep,

34:08.599 --> 34:09.839
so don't blame me.

34:12.280 --> 34:14.198
You're getting more foolish by the day.

34:14.199 --> 34:16.959
Young Master gave me this money.

34:18.719 --> 34:19.678
Eat it secretly.

34:19.679 --> 34:21.240
Don't let those two see it.

34:25.940 --> 34:29.220
♪Step by step, page by page♪

34:29.300 --> 34:32.180
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

34:32.340 --> 34:38.459
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

34:38.460 --> 34:41.539
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

34:41.540 --> 34:44.459
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

34:44.460 --> 34:51.020
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

35:04.760 --> 35:05.760
Xiaopu,

35:05.864 --> 35:07.150
hurry and take your mistress out.

35:07.159 --> 35:09.380
♪And around weathered corridors♪

35:09.860 --> 35:14.780
♪One moment of peace
brings a little brightness♪

35:15.199 --> 35:16.320
Young Lady,

35:16.599 --> 35:18.399
Master Wei is still waiting.

35:19.079 --> 35:19.879
Let's go.

35:19.880 --> 35:22.180
♪Nor chase
the changing tides of the world♪

35:24.679 --> 35:26.399
I only said a few words.

35:26.760 --> 35:27.919
Why are you so upset?

35:27.920 --> 35:29.160
Is that really necessary?

35:32.079 --> 35:34.359
We have plenty of time ahead of us.

35:36.719 --> 35:38.280
We'll see about that.

35:41.320 --> 35:42.198
Wait for me.

35:42.199 --> 35:44.420
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

35:45.280 --> 35:45.999
Take care.

35:47.260 --> 35:53.260
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

36:13.039 --> 36:14.919
Leaving already, Young Lady Shuang?

36:15.112 --> 36:16.870
Be careful not
to bring yourself bad luck.

36:18.079 --> 36:18.999
Understood.

36:19.000 --> 36:21.039
Take care, Young Lady Shuang.

36:27.960 --> 36:29.078
She's asleep.

36:29.079 --> 36:30.280
It's all right.

36:41.880 --> 36:43.280
Young Master Wang,

36:43.360 --> 36:44.879
take it slowly.

36:44.920 --> 36:46.479
Watch your step.

36:47.280 --> 36:48.399
All right.

36:55.840 --> 36:57.080
Shuang.

36:57.599 --> 36:59.519
Going to see Master Wei?

37:09.320 --> 37:11.158
It's certainly lively downstairs today.

37:11.159 --> 37:13.680
Hearing all that
has put her in a foul mood.

37:23.079 --> 37:24.879
That little wretch.

37:25.199 --> 37:27.959
You'll have plenty more
to be upset about.

37:39.599 --> 37:41.160
Young Master Wang,

37:41.840 --> 37:44.399
Young Lady Liu Qing is inside.

37:44.440 --> 37:46.479
I'll leave you two alone.

37:54.960 --> 37:56.439
Young Lady Liu Qing,

37:56.599 --> 37:58.080
I'm here.

37:58.679 --> 38:01.160
Sir, I'm shy.

38:01.320 --> 38:02.999
Turn off the light.

38:03.199 --> 38:04.800
All right.

38:21.760 --> 38:22.839
Shuang!

38:23.440 --> 38:24.479
Someone!

38:24.800 --> 38:25.839
Liu Yueniang!

38:26.960 --> 38:28.080
Liu Yueniang!

38:28.840 --> 38:31.030
How dare you pass her off
as an untouched maiden

38:31.039 --> 38:32.160
and cheat me out of my money?

38:32.679 --> 38:33.640
Out of my way!

38:33.760 --> 38:35.439
- Young Master Wang!
- What...

38:35.519 --> 38:36.680
Quickly!

38:51.320 --> 38:52.999
Liu Qing has escaped!

38:53.119 --> 38:54.559
All of you, go after her!

38:55.119 --> 38:55.558
Yes!

38:55.559 --> 38:57.320
She can't have gone far.

38:57.360 --> 38:59.359
You must bring her back!

38:59.360 --> 39:00.359
- After her!
- Yes!

39:03.992 --> 39:05.510
(Yangzhou Watergate Wharf)

39:05.528 --> 39:07.270
Anyone else taking the large boat?

39:07.280 --> 39:08.919
Hurry aboard the ferry!

39:17.239 --> 39:18.919
Once he's aboard my boat,

39:18.920 --> 39:20.959
(Luo Dalang)
unless Heaven itself comes for him,

39:20.960 --> 39:23.720
(Leader of the Boatmen's Guild)
no one else can get him off my boat.

39:24.199 --> 39:25.800
With him in your hands,

39:26.480 --> 39:27.839
I can rest easy.

39:43.760 --> 39:44.760
Lin,

39:46.280 --> 39:48.039
you came to Yangzhou this time

39:48.159 --> 39:50.279
to ask me to help you find a woman.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.200
Anything else,

39:51.440 --> 39:52.999
I know nothing about.

39:55.880 --> 39:57.039
There's one more thing

39:57.559 --> 39:59.039
I need your help with.

40:00.840 --> 40:02.879
I can already tell it's risky.

40:04.320 --> 40:05.760
There is some risk,

40:06.159 --> 40:07.600
but the credit will be great, too.

40:09.960 --> 40:11.039
Young Master.

40:14.599 --> 40:15.600
Where is she?

40:21.440 --> 40:22.600
Qingyan House.

40:23.440 --> 40:24.800
Nanke has already gone ahead.

40:30.100 --> 40:34.940
(Zhenhuai Gate)

40:57.559 --> 40:58.600
Hurry!

40:58.920 --> 41:00.120
Search carefully.

41:05.032 --> 41:06.800
There's no way
she could've left the city.

41:07.039 --> 41:08.800
Stop following me. Go look over there!

41:36.159 --> 41:38.039
There's no way
she could've left the city.

41:47.448 --> 41:48.910
Where did this chicken come from?

41:48.920 --> 41:50.240
Help me catch my chicken!

41:52.679 --> 41:54.238
Where did all these chickens come from?

41:54.239 --> 41:55.359
Move!

41:57.480 --> 41:58.799
What's going on over there?

41:58.800 --> 41:59.680
No idea.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.559
Sir,

42:06.000 --> 42:08.120
you work so hard every day.

42:09.360 --> 42:11.999
Have you seen a young lady today

42:12.000 --> 42:13.439
traveling alone,

42:13.440 --> 42:14.919
about this tall?

42:15.159 --> 42:15.638
No.

42:15.639 --> 42:16.760
Grandma, slow down.

42:17.280 --> 42:18.280
Thank you.

42:20.480 --> 42:21.439
All right.

42:22.159 --> 42:23.280
Keep looking.

42:23.840 --> 42:25.559
Hurry.

42:46.460 --> 42:48.260
(Zhenhuai Gate)

43:05.180 --> 43:07.660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.719 --> 43:10.839
If you had nothing to hide,

43:12.760 --> 43:15.039
why would you be afraid
of me pretending to be a ghost?

43:17.599 --> 43:20.399
There's another old
saying that's even better.

43:20.519 --> 43:23.039
Money can make
even a ghost turn a millstone.

43:23.920 --> 43:25.759
I have wealth and power.

43:25.760 --> 43:27.640
I can catch and destroy ghosts,

43:27.719 --> 43:29.559
and even make
them turn millstones for me.

43:30.239 --> 43:31.519
But you...

43:36.239 --> 43:38.160
can only be a ghost.

43:56.300 --> 44:00.420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:03.260 --> 44:07.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:09.060 --> 44:12.980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:13.660 --> 44:16.420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:17.140 --> 44:19.460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:19.460 --> 44:22.540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:24.060 --> 44:28.300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:31.220 --> 44:35.380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:37.180 --> 44:40.740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:40.740 --> 44:44.300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:45.100 --> 44:50.780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:51.140 --> 44:55.460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:55.820 --> 44:58.780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:58.780 --> 45:02.540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:02.540 --> 45:05.420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:05.420 --> 45:09.500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:09.500 --> 45:12.860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:12.860 --> 45:16.620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:16.620 --> 45:20.620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:21.380 --> 45:25.540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:25.540 --> 45:28.980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:28.980 --> 45:32.620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:32.620 --> 45:35.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:35.500 --> 45:39.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:39.580 --> 45:42.940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:42.940 --> 45:46.580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:46.580 --> 45:54.380
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
